  <section|Connected clusters and real logarithm><label|connected-clusters-and-real-logarithm>

  <verbatim|cluster-expansion.tex> initial hash
  <verbatim|7cef87fd1c751b3685669c32bccac1cc16d7dcda44f7ff2f34cae8696d21dad9>
  is under independent review. Full targeted reads under
  <verbatim|Lean/YM/Push/ABSOLUTE_SUMS/>: <verbatim|Graph>,
  <verbatim|Parent>, <verbatim|Weigh>, <verbatim|Forest>,
  <verbatim|Clusters>, <verbatim|Ursell>, <verbatim|Gas>, <verbatim|Coef>,
  <verbatim|FiniteLog>, <verbatim|Log>; <verbatim|Breadth> through its
  build/uniqueness interface. Source correspondence:

  <\itemize-minus>
    <item><verbatim|YM.Push.AbsoluteSums.Graph.pay>: breadth-first intervals,
    cancellation of alternating connected graphs. Occurrence labels may
    repeat.

    <item><verbatim|YM.Push.AbsoluteSums.Trees.parent_fanout>,
    <verbatim|trees_afford>, <verbatim|forest_at>, <verbatim|root_at>: child
    factorials and normalized overlap kernels, exact degreePrice
    <verbatim|4*(2B+1)^4*gamma/delta>. Text proves the count by weak
    compositions instead of the equivalent inductive factorial identity.

    <item><verbatim|YM.Push.AbsoluteSums.Ursell.{budget_root,cluster_at,cluster_tail,pay_cover,log_hit_tail}>:
    root average with normalization <verbatim|(m+1)!>, actual union support,
    geometric tail.

    <item><verbatim|YM.Push.AbsoluteSums.Coef.recurrence>,
    <verbatim|Gas.exact_polynomial>, <verbatim|Gas.price_log>: connected
    component decomposition, real ODE on an interval containing [0,1],
    finite-alphabet exhaustion with absolute majorants. Positivity is proved,
    not assumed to permit taking the logarithm.
  </itemize-minus>

  This supplies the combinatorial connected-tail and log-normalization input
  of leaf-expansion from a vertex site bound. It does not supply the analytic
  vertex bound of the actual nonlinear block integral. Shared literature
  README was consulted previously; these elementary source-specific proofs
  were followed without an extensive external search. No Lean source
  modifications or build.

  Commands actually run this checkpoint: targeted rg/cat/sed; two zsh globs
  for nonexistent paths failed before reads and were replaced with exact
  paths; <verbatim|python3 scripts/check_blueprint.py> passed (structure
  only). The intermediate 162-page PDF compiled with only the known
  unresolved <verbatim|ex-centered-sail> reference. Later chapter PDF build
  and visual QA remain in progress.

  The independent reviewer passed <verbatim|cluster-expansion.tex> at the
  recorded hash, checking the graph cancellation, factorials, support reserve
  and logarithm ODE.

